Suggested 4-week plan

Week	Goals
1	Finalize requirements, design UI, set up the FastAPI project and Gemini API access
2	Build the script-generation endpoint, then image generation
3	Connect frontend to backend, add error handling, print and save features
4	Testing, bug fixes, documentation, demo preparation

Roles (for a team): frontend developer, backend and AI developer, tester and documenter. A solo developer covers all three.

Tools: VS Code, Git/GitHub, Postman or the /docs page for API testing, and a .env file for the API key.

Risks and mitigations

Risk	Mitigation
Slow image generation	Generate panels in parallel, show loading shimmer, cap panels at 8
API quota or cost	Rate-limit per user, cache results
Malformed AI output	Validate JSON with Pydantic and retry once
Inconsistent characters	Repeat a fixed character description in every image prompt
Unsafe content	Use safety settings and input filtering
